Z||000006||MinnGreenGT||11-15-2001||12:54 PM||||Hey... I didn't see this one.  Hmmm. I know a good place to get that 4:10 Tranny  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  Oh yeah- you do too!<P>Anyway, the question is for color?  I think black (for the most part) is overused.  Of course, your budget for paint will have some effect on your color choices.  If you can afford it (expensive) check with the <A HREF="http://www.houseofkolor.com" TARGET=_blank>House of Kolor</A>, they have some of the best paints in existence.  For color scheme- I've been thinking about the cool metallic blue that I see around on Dodge Vehicles... or if you want to go really wild a metallic orange!  Just something to think about.<P>------------------<BR>              <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/GreenGT6.gif"> ||||reg||1
